        527.30126953125,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic accuracy studies evaluating sensitivity, specificity and concordance (agreement)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.773193359375,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "of TBSTs were identified. There were no identified studies on the efficacy of TPT based on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        527.2703857421875,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic test results, on the predictive value for progression to TB disease or on the proportion",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950337409973145,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        143.64120483398438,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "started on TPT.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        166.069091796875,
        527.0801391601562,
        179.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "The assessed evidence for Cy-Tb and C-TST has included a manufacturer-recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.569091796875,
        526.9656372070312,
        194.71409606933594
      ],
      "text": "induration of at least 5 mm as the cut-off. According to the Diaskintest instructions for use,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.069091796875,
        526.6314086914062,
        210.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "the presence of induration of any size is considered a positive response. However, the assessed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986641883850098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.569091796875,
        526.9039306640625,
        225.71409606933594
      ],
      "text": "evidence also included some studies for Diaskintest that used an induration of at least 5 mm",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.069091796875,
        263.11090087890625,
        241.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "as a cut-off, specified where applicable.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.2271270751953,
        125.23908996582031,
        265.14111328125
      ],
      "text": "Sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.0770263671875,
        526.9808959960938,
        289.2220458984375
      ],
      "text": "A total of 20 studies involving 1627 participants provided data for evaluating the sensitivity of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.5770263671875,
        526.9644775390625,
        304.7220458984375
      ],
      "text": "TBSTs in people with microbiologically confirmed TB, which was used as a proxy for sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.0770263671875,
        526.9097900390625,
        320.2220458984375
      ],
      "text": "to diagnose TB infection. Of these, six studies with 539 participants were head-to-head",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.5769958496094,
        526.958984375,
        335.7220153808594
      ],
      "text": "comparisons with the TST or IGRAs (or both); 17 studies included 1276 participants who were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.0769958496094,
        527.0997314453125,
        351.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "HIV-negative or whose HIV status was unknown; five studies included 317 PLHIV; and four",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.5769958496094,
        527.0029907226562,
        366.7220153808594
      ],
      "text": "studies included 34 participants aged under 18 years. Of the included studies, 14 evaluated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.0769958496094,
        430.8136901855469,
        382.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "Diaskintest, four Cy-Tb and three C-TST, as shown in  Figs. 3.1.1.1–3.1.1.2.",
